    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "If the antipodal differential residual has degree at most three, the monic direction U is uniquely the reversed degree-r truncation of E(z)^(-1/4), where E=z^4D(z^-1). Exact norm contact becomes an exact gap in the first omitted coefficients. The official generic boundary requires two consecutive zero coefficients and the intermediate boundary requires one.",
